      - RoomEnd Door3 Light
  - text: '```"I choose death."'
    displayText: '"I choose death."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 0
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika said it first, $$but Maya's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. $$They made the same choice.
    displayText: Rika said it first, but Maya's soft voice came a fraction of a second
      later. They made the same choice.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 14000000140000004d0000004d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I can't carry this burden anymore, $$Maya. $$The truth is that I killed
      Mahiru, $$I did bad things to everyone, $$and the truth will stay the same.
    displayText: I can't carry this burden anymore, Maya. The truth is that I killed
      Mahiru, I did bad things to everyone, and the truth will stay the same.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 230000002300000029000000290000004c0000004c0000006a0000006a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's too much.$.$.
    displayText: It's too much...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.06
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0e0000000f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You are only human, $$Rika. $$And you've reached your limit a long time
      ago.
    displayText: You are only human, Rika. And you've reached your limit a long time
      ago.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 14000000140000001a0000001a000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: If I go back there, $$I would just be a burden to others. $$I would drag
      them down with me even if I don't intend to do it.
    displayText: If I go back there, I would just be a burden to others. I would
      drag them down with me even if I don't intend to do it.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd7424e912b1ed242be9b05b9e0c8d66, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 14000000140000003800000038000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's fine.
    displayText: It's fine.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1899c048cbc3cbf46ad8477960b7a91e, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I don't want to hate myself more than this.$.$.
    displayText: I don't want to hate myself more than this...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2b0000002c000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: That's totally fine.
    displayText: That's totally fine.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "I\u2014I just want it to end."
    displayText: "I\u2014I just want it to end."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a4248579003fdf418680a2fa89b0526, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Then let it end, $$Rika. $$Let's go together.
    displayText: Then let it end, Rika. Let's go together.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 11000000110000001700000017000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: They walked towards the door. $$The red spider lily blooms, $$welcoming
      them to the land of nothingness. $$A void even darker than the void they came
      from.
    displayText: They walked towards the door. The red spider lily blooms, welcoming
      them to the land of nothingness. A void even darker than the void they came
      from.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e0000003a0000003a0000006500000065000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: This is the final choice they made by themselves, $$and the only choice
      that will satisfy her.
    displayText: This is the final choice they made by themselves, and the only choice
      that will satisfy her.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3200000032000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The door swings open.
    displayText: The door swings open.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: No light. $$No sound. $$No pain. $$Nothing.
    displayText: No light. No sound. No pain. Nothing.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a00000014000000140000001d0000001d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Nothing, $$but Rika and Maya.
    displayText: Nothing, but Rika and Maya.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0900000009000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Nothing, $$but a girl who has committed a sin so grave that she couldn't
      forgive herself.
    displayText: Nothing, but a girl who has committed a sin so grave that she couldn't
      forgive herself.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0900000009000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And.$.$.
    displayText: And...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '                                                                        '
    displayText: '                                                                        '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 3
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
